        "title": "Link e attributi",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vediamo come funzionano i link per collegare un <strong>menu di gioco</strong> ad altre <strong>schermate di gioco</strong>. Fai clic su <code>Start mission!</code> per usare il link.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA; &lt;style&gt;&#xA;  body {&#xA;   background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #1f4037, #99f2c8);&#xA;   text-align: center;&#xA;   font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;, Sans-serif;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  img {&#xA;   margin: 40px;&#xA;   height: 40px;&#xA;   width: 150px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h1 {&#xA;   margin-top: 30px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h3 {&#xA;   margin: 20px;&#xA;   font-weight: normal;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  p {&#xA;   margin-top: 80px;&#xA;   margin-left: 30px;&#xA;   margin-right: 30px;&#xA;   padding: 20px;&#xA;   background-color: DimGray;&#xA;  }&#xA; &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA; &lt;h1&gt;Ready to play?&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;a&#xA;  href=&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;&gt;Start&#xA;  mission!&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per iniziare a creare un link, aggiungi il testo tra i tag <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>. Il testo non verrà ancora evidenziato.</p><p><code>&lt;a&gt;</code> indica il tag \"Anchor\".</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Open Inventory\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per collegare il testo a una pagina web, aggiungiamo <code>href=\"\"</code> insieme a un Uniform Resource Locator (<strong>URL</strong>). <code>href</code> è l'abbreviazione di \"hypertext reference\".</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/leaderboard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View High Scores\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://example.com/leaderboard\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> è un <strong>attributo</strong>. Tutti gli attributi hanno due cose in comune: forniscono informazioni aggiuntive e si trovano all'interno del tag di apertura.</p><p>Gli attributi vengono aggiunti dopo il nome del tag e prima del segno di chiusura <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/settings&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Settings\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Colleghiamo a una pagina web aggiungendo <code>=</code> dopo l'attributo e un URL come valore tra virgolette.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/credits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View Credits\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>\"</code> e poi <code>https://example.com/credits</code>, <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> con l'attributo <code>href</code> impostato su <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-select&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Choose Level\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>a</code> e poi <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://example.com/level-select\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
