            "id": 144759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono gli <code>attributes</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per fornire informazioni aggiuntive sui tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per trasformare tutti i tag in nemici</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per fornire informazioni aggiuntive sui tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il tag di apertura che rende il link cliccabile.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/wiki&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a href=\"https://example.com/wiki\"&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi l'attributo e il suo valore in modo che facendo clic sul link i giocatori vengano indirizzati alla pagina della community del gioco.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/community&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Join the Community\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://example.com/community\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
